+// branches: an all-true mask must MOVE the decoded columns to the output (no gather,
+// verified by device-pointer identity), an all-false mask must emit the schema-correct
+// empty batch, a mixed mask must gather exactly the surviving rows, and a view-backed
+// (cache-served) input must keep the folded filter gather instead of the move shortcut.
